<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS V FENERBAHCE TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS V FENERBAHCE TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup Champions' League group C match between Juventus of Italy and Turkey's Fenerbahce:</p>
<p>Juventus: 1-Angelo Peruzzi, 3-Moreno Torricelli, 5-Sergio Porrini, 4-Paolo Montero, 7-Angelo Di Livio, 13-Mark Iuliano, 19-Attilio Lombardo, 20-Alessio Tacchinardi, 21-Zinedine Zidane, 10-Alessandro Del Piero, 11-Michele Padovano.</p>
<p>Fenerbahce: 1-Rustu Recber, 15-Erol Bulut, 14-Saffet Akbas, 3-Uche Okechekwu, 2-Ilker Yagcioglu, 8-Tuncuy Akgun, 10-Augustine Okocha, 4-Jes Hogh, 5-Senturk Kemalettin, 9-Elvir Bolic, 11-Emil Kostadinov.</p>
</text>
